用超心理意识能量方法，开始鸡蛋返生，20分后鸡蛋返生成功。\n\n并且已经成功返生了40多枚。 https://t.co/eoWoNqzpk8","url":"https://x.com/RobinSeun/status/2115773946868150488"},{"author_id":"1954166149","created_at":"2026-10-29T11:51:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115773443899830598"],"id":"2115773443899830598","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2571,"like_count":24,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":2},"text":"旺柴是BSC这段时间最硬的MEME，甚至没有之一。\n\n我持有PEPE，也有旺柴\n\n旺柴作为出现最频繁的表情之一\n\n虽然是中文社区的产物，但全世界通用\n\n我现在已经集齐了旺柴很多周边\n\n帽子、衣服、包包、袜子、鼠标垫、抱枕、手机支架。\n\n这么多旺柴，看来今年一定旺。\n\n希望早点上Alpha。@WangChaiBsc https://t.co/G3sGeB11Fp","url":"https://x.com/monkeyjiang/status/2115773443899830598"},{"author_id":"1823248694805962752","created_at":"2026-10-29T11:49:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115772887596765322"],"id":"2115772887596765322","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":18708,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":44,"retweet_count":0},"text":"瘾来了 https://t.co/sEcZpKukXO","url":"https://x.com/Sexytodashu/status/2115772887596765322"},{"author_id":"28940967","created_at":"2026-10-29T11:48:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115772752846336139"],"id":"2115772752846336139","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":53,"impression_count":30844,"like_count":161,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":9},"text":"这就是目前意识形态领域管理的三朵乌云，三大包袱。\n\n一个是原教旨共产主义教条，包括8小时工作制，按需分配，医疗教育福利等等，\n\n一个是毛的历史定位，1978年不敢否定，现在就更不能否定了，\n\n一个是提都不敢提的一次事件。\n\n意识形态无论提出新路线和新思路，这三朵乌云依然处于长期存在的状态。 https://t.co/7PPGHQwFIP","url":"https://x.com/lidangzzz/status/2115772752846336139"},{"author_id":"28940967","created_at":"2026-10-29T11:33:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115769002504909157"],"id":"2115769002504909157","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":9917,"like_count":20,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我说一句啊，北京很多Texas烤肉最大的问题，是肉比较干巴，里面没什么味道，全靠撒料和蘸酱。\n\nTexas有一些餐厅的做法是，每人上一大碗熬浓的肉汁，肉在慢烤全部软烂的前提下，可以一边吃一边蘸肉汁，但前提是肉汁必须是热的，并且上面有一层厚厚的牛油保温。\n\n这种吃法在Texas本地也是非主流， https://t.co/abMH4TSqNn","url":"https://x.com/lidangzzz/status/2115769002504909157"},{"author_id":"1945954852565286912","created_at":"2026-10-29T11:32:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115768834561089960"],"id":"2115768834561089960","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":938,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"\"周末安排了家庭聚会，期待与亲人团聚！👨‍👩‍👧‍👦\"","url":"https://x.com/1_sexalone/status/2115768834561089960"},{"author_id":"36659991","created_at":"2026-10-29T11:19:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115765586781479015"],"id":"2115765586781479015","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1174,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@Grok ，帮我翻译一下这段说的是啥？用印文。 https://t.co/1GdTz8okXP","url":"https://x.com/kenw_2/status/2115765586781479015"},{"author_id":"50683","created_at":"2026-10-29T11:19:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115765361417257093"],"id":"2115765361417257093","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2861,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"突然意识到，还有 3 年，30 后就出生了。","url":"https://x.com/dingyi/status/2115765361417257093"},{"author_id":"28940967","created_at":"2026-10-29T11:15:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115764524741513354"],"id":"2115764524741513354","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":17719,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"text":"英国的一批大学全部都滚下去了。\n\n事实证明，除了牛津剑桥以外，UCL、ICL这几个大学水平也不行，毕业生基本被清华吊打，跟北大毕业生质量差不多，真实水平就是全球50名左右。\n\n我这份排名是符合绝大多数人直觉的排名，因为英国学校确实水，在其他榜单可以靠其他分项刷上来，在我这里是掺不了水的。 https://t.co/CqdMj467nn https://t.co/bBFLoXU38x","url":"https://x.com/lidangzzz/status/2115764524741513354"},{"author_id":"3319804777","created_at":"2026-10-29T11:03:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115761499306336591"],"id":"2115761499306336591","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":926,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":3},"text":"一把化妆刷如何“刷”出美丽经济？\n“美妆刷儿千千万，河北沧州青县占大半”。近日，英国博主亚当走进河北省沧州市青县，探秘“中国化妆刷之乡”的产业密码。\n每年，上亿支化妆刷从这里走向全球，支撑起年产值约35亿元的产业规模。小小化妆刷，连接全球大市场，“刷”亮县域经济发展新底色。 https://t.co/hnKTB7ceso","url":"https://x.com/XinhuaChinese/status/2115761499306336591"},{"author_id":"1516941936971554817","created_at":"2026-10-29T11:02:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115761074536607917"],"id":"2115761074536607917","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":37,"impression_count":16607,"like_count":96,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":46,"retweet_count":10},"text":"未来的 3 个时间点我会引用回这篇推：\n\n2029 年的 8 月份、2030 年的 8 月份、2033 年的 6 月份。 https://t.co/UQqrN5L3gv https://t.co/p84VuVpqBV","url":"https://x.com/wolfyxbt/status/2115761074536607917"},{"author_id":"28940967","created_at":"2026-10-29T10:48:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115757673790529644"],"id":"2115757673790529644","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":67,"impression_count":25855,"like_count":132,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":14},"text":"这份榜单叫做CollegeRank。\n\n只把学校毕业的本硕博计算在全球其他大学担任教授教职的DAG整个图模型建出来，按照google起家的pagerank来计算大学权重，\n\n基本原理非常简单，如果A大学毕业本硕博轻松去B大学任职，而B大学毕业生很难去A大学任职，那么就可以认为A大学比B大学要好。 https://t.co/chcjBilQNh","url":"https://x.com/lidangzzz/status/2115757673790529644"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"3319804777","name":"New China 中文","username":"XinhuaChinese"},{"id":"1823248694805962752","name":"Big叔","username":"Sexytodashu"},{"id":"1456122926432862223","name":"大漂亮| C Labs","username":"giantcutie666"},{"id":"55964567","name":"吴祚来","username":"wuzuolai"},{"id":"1459908073644953603","name":"先知","username":"Crypto_He"},{"id":"50683","name":"Ding","username":"dingyi"},{"id":"28940967","name":"lidang 立党 （劝人卖房/学CS/买SP500/纳100/OpenAI/Anthrop第一人）","username":"lidangzzz"},{"id":"1531801543","name":"人民日報  People's Daily","username":"PDChinese"},{"id":"2087534840505933824","name":"柒柒","username":"yaoka1xin77"},{"id":"116